    /// `resource_limits_is_descending_holds_on_the_descending_shipped_preset_triple`.
    ///
    /// **Ascending shipped-preset triple rejection**: `ResourceLimits::
    /// is_descending(&[EMPTY_RESOURCE_LIMITS, DEFAULT_RESOURCE_LIMITS,
