    /// with short-circuit on the first top axis — matching
    /// [`Self::has_bottom_axis`]'s shape verbatim on the DUAL per-axis
    /// mask, and mirroring [`Self::has_polar_axis`]'s shape one CELL
    /// axis over on the compound cell.
