    /// tie-leg behaviour on the CARDINAL projection. Pinned via
    /// `resource_limits_balance_implies_both_leads_none`.
    ///
    /// **SOME-count partition contract**: for every posture `a`,
    /// `usize::from(a.polar_lead().is_some()) + usize::from(a
