    /// [`Self::is_atomically_balanced`] preset pins, and NARROWER
    /// than the paired [`Self::has_majority_axis`] which fires on ALL
    /// FIVE uniform fixtures.
    ///
    /// **Truly-mixed test-local witnesses**: `SPARSE_BOTTOM_POSTURE
