    /// Some(FIELD_COUNT)` (every axis at top pole; every axis polar);
    /// `DEFAULT_RESOURCE_LIMITS.polar_axis_index_span() == None` (every
    /// `DEFAULT_MAX_*` strictly interior; no polar axis).
