    /// interior); `UNBOUNDED_RESOURCE_LIMITS.interior_axis_is_sparse()
    /// == None` (no interior); `HAND_AUTHORED_MID_POSTURE
    /// .interior_axis_is_sparse() == Some(false)` (every field strictly
