    /// strictly stronger than the MULTI regime (`count == FIELD_COUNT ⇒
    /// count > 1` because FIELD_COUNT == 6 > 1). Pinned via
    /// `resource_limits_polar_axis_is_saturated_true_implies_is_multi_true`.
