        // `is_bottom` verdict — pinning the (scalar,
        // per-axis-mask) 2-cell face on the bottom-pole projection.
        // Sibling posture to the conjunction-recovers-`leq` contract
        // on `axes_leq` one PREDICATE-KIND axis over.
