        // SPARSE_BOTTOM_POSTURE and CONTIGUOUS_INTERIOR_BOTTOM_POSTURE
        // both fire bottom_is_majority but REJECT polar_is_majority
        // (they carry a 3-3 polar-interior tie) — the atomic MAJORITY
